        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/9a5b8b5d47676d4a2cdff52a702c8a7e.avif?t=1776791060\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dragons Frolic!</strong> you collect little dragons, which you can enter into dragon races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They'd love to find a home on your second monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute little dragons frolicking around you! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different types of dragons and their color variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dragons sheds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, raise and sell dragons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your favorite dragons into races, collect treasure and unlock new shed decorations!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.apng?t=1776791060\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.poster.avif?t=1776791060\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/9a5b8b5d47676d4a2cdff52a702c8a7e.avif?t=1776791060\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dragons Frolic!</strong> you collect little dragons, which you can enter into dragon races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They'd love to find a home on your second monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute little dragons frolicking around you! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different types of dragons and their color variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dragons sheds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, raise and sell dragons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your favorite dragons into races, collect treasure and unlock new shed decorations!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.apng?t=1776791060\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.poster.avif?t=1776791060\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
